{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run trains freely in a model railway-style diorama world -- a physics-based digital railway diorama.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate and watch trains run across open railway lines featuring a variety of environments such as mountain routes, cities, and harbors, and enjoy the world of railways from different perspectives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Physics-Based Train Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trains in this game do not simply follow predetermined paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, wheels actually rotate and roll along the rails, allowing trains to move through the world using a physics-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train behavior changes depending on factors such as speed and weight, creating dynamic and engaging train movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 A Model Railway-Inspired Diorama World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Railway lines pass through a variety of landscapes including mountains, cities, and ports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy watching trains run through these environments from multiple viewpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the charm of a model railway layout brought to life in a digital world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 The Chamland Republic and Its Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in the Chamland Republic, a newly developing city-state located in a mountainous region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a railway operator, you will complete various missions and contribute to the growth and development of the country.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 A Light Cooperative System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are loosely connected through a contribution system and can work together toward shared goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the world and help expand the railway network.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897310?t=1773179684","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897310?t=1773179684","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897310/a465489a622ea1a07f21cc8d1a4908ba82894595/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773179684","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897310/a465489a622ea1a07f21cc8d1a4908ba82894595/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773179684","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4018880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run trains freely in a model railway-style diorama world -- a physics-based digital railway diorama.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate and watch trains run across open railway lines featuring a variety of environments such as mountain routes, cities, and harbors, and enjoy the world of railways from different perspectives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Physics-Based Train Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trains in this game do not simply follow predetermined paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, wheels actually rotate and roll along the rails, allowing trains to move through the world using a physics-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train behavior changes depending on factors such as speed and weight, creating dynamic and engaging train movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 A Model Railway-Inspired Diorama World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Railway lines pass through a variety of landscapes including mountains, cities, and ports.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy watching trains run through these environments from multiple viewpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the charm of a model railway layout brought to life in a digital world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 The Chamland Republic and Its Missions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in the Chamland Republic, a newly developing city-state located in a mountainous region.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a railway operator, you will complete various missions and contribute to the growth and development of the country.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 A Light Cooperative System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are loosely connected through a contribution system and can work together toward shared goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the world and help expand the railway network.</p>","developers":["Cham-gaming"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897310/324a431e600483eb1a843fca1c1e060afe29dde5/header.jpg?t=1773179684","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897310/1140262107/a5755ff7001a9e8af31e4c80b7bd10d3abbfd06a/1770820360/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770821619","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897310/1140262107/a5755ff7001a9e8af31e4c80b7bd10d3abbfd06a/1770820360/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770821619","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3897310/1140262107/a5755ff7001a9e8af31e4c80b7bd10d3abbfd06a/1770820360/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770821619","id":257284557,"name":"Short_2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257284557/d5323241d773aab508b9a66021eb4afea2571852/movie_600x337.j